  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Baked Potato.png|left|200px|Baked Potato]]\n\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Products|Product]]\n |level = 35\n |price = 1 to 298\n |time = 35 minutes\n |source = {{Infoicon|bbqg|bigger|link=BBQ Grill}}\n |xp = 36\n |base = 83\n |dia = 3\n |time3 = 29 minutes\n}}\n'''Baked potatoes''' are [[products]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 35.\n\nLike all [[products]], they are stored in the [[barn]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Making baked potatoes'''===\n[[File:BBQ Grill.png|150px|left|BBQ Grill]]\nBaked potatoes are made in the [[BBQ Grill]].\n\nTo make a baked potato, players need the following ingredients, in the specified quantities:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"4\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: .5em 0;\"\n|-\n|[[File:Potato.png|75px|Potato|link=Potato]]\n|[[File:Chili Pepper.png|75px|Chili pepper|link=Chili Pepper]]\n|[[File:Cream.png|75px|Cream|link=Cream]]\n|[[File:Cheese.png|75px|Cheese|link=Cheese]]\n|-\n|'''x2'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|'''x1'''\n|}\nIt takes 35 minutes to make one baked potato, and 29 minutes in a fully [[Masteries|mastered]] grill. Each potato gives players 36 [[experience]] points.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Selling baked potatoes'''===\n[[File:Roadside Shop.png|150px|left|Roadside Shop]]\n* Baked potatoes can be bought or sold for a maximum price of 2,988 {{Infoicon|Coin}} for 10 units.\n* Buying the ingredients required to make a potato costs 280 {{Infoicon|Coin}} coins.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Boat orders'''===\n[[File:Riverboat.png|150px|left|Riverboat]]\n* [[Boat]] orders ask for 1 to 2 baked potatoes per crate, up to a total of 8 per boat.\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Ofenkartoffel\n|es = Patata asada\n|fr = Patate au Four\n|it = Patata al forno ripiena\n|nl = Gepofte Aardappel\n|no = Bakt potet\n|ru = Печёный картофель\n|zh = Baked Potato\n}}\n[[pt-br:Batata assada]]\n\n[[Category:BBQ Grill Products]]\n[[Category:Cream Products]]\n[[Category:Cheese Products]]\n[[Category:Chili Pepper Products]]\n[[Category:Potato Products]]",
